SCH-TE-01 termination discards what is pending without sending it, and the scheduler then rejects every delay -> next=marker from deadLetters | pending: cancel=true isCancelled=true cancel=false isCancelled=true | zero => ERR IllegalStateException [cannot enqueue after timer shutdown] | 1s => ERR IllegalStateException [cannot enqueue after timer shutdown] | too far => ERR IllegalStateException [cannot enqueue after timer shutdown]
